{"id": "68848", "title": "不三不四", "author": "千木", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 23, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68848.htm", "intro": "为心爱的弟弟，他娶她。为忘记一个人，她嫁他。 \r\n没爱、没情、没婚礼，两张结婚证，他俩成了夫妻。 \r\n本无交集的两人，原以为能像所有的无感情夫妻一样太平度日，没成想生活没让他们如意，一次次亲眼目睹她的不轨，一次次被他冷嘲热讽，一次次脱离初衷。 \r\n野男人找上门，他大方让上楼，请进她房，他立于门外，细细品味屋内声响，百思不得其解，为什么男人们一个个为她疯狂。面对其他男人，他冷眼旁观，“喜欢就拿去。” \r\n原本就没感情，她不该心伤。可后来的后来，还是放在心上了，只是过程太过凄凉。 \r\n陆末：既然我爱上了你，你就必须同样爱我。 \r\n了不不：爱你，不过如此。 \r\n是谁雪月了风花，又是谁沧桑了岁月？", "base": "files/article/html/68/68848", "chapters": [{"title": "1-10", "file": "10548892.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "10548893.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10548894.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-35", "file": "10548895.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-46", "file": "10548896.html", "available": false}, {"title": "47-58", "file": "10548897.html", "available": false}, {"title": "59-71", "file": "10548898.html", "available": false}, {"title": "72-84", "file": "10548899.html", "available": false}, {"title": "85-95", "file": "10548900.html", "available": false}, {"title": "96-106", "file": "10548901.html", "available": false}, {"title": "107-117", "file": "10548902.html", "available": false}, {"title": "118-127", "file": "10548903.html", "available": false}, {"title": "128-137", "file": "10548904.html", "available": false}, {"title": "138-150", "file": "10548905.html", "available": false}, {"title": "151-160", "file": "10548906.html", "available": false}, {"title": "161-170", "file": "10548907.html", "available": false}, {"title": "171-180", "file": "10548908.html", "available": false}, {"title": "181-190", "file": "10548909.html", "available": false}, {"title": "191-200", "file": "10548910.html", "available": false}, {"title": "201-210", "file": "10548911.html", "available": false}, {"title": "211-220", "file": "10548912.html", "available": false}, {"title": "221-230", "file": "10548913.html", "available": fals